  "mechanisms": [
    "Enhanced positive affect may have influenced the ability to engage in divergent thinking.",
    "Increased motivation, which in turn is mediated by more positive affectivity.",
    "Natural elements within the environment invoke a reduction in the stress response, resulting in the restoration of mood states."
  ],
  "moderators": [
    "Cognitive fatigue (discussed as a potential factor for null effects on alertness/attention)"
  ],
  "implementation_implications": [
    "Architects, interior designers, and developers should endeavour to incorporate window views of foliage and additional biophilic features within interior designs to enhance affect, cognitive performance, and wellbeing.",
    "Nature-based VR could be used and further evaluated within various fields such as clinical psychology, health, education, as a tool for improving wellbeing."
  ],
